# Pull request creation (Dose)

Create or edit PRs **only** when asked.

Before creating: `git status`, `git diff`, `git log main...HEAD`, `git diff main...HEAD`, plus tests/lint/build (see `git-push`).

- **Base**: `main`
- **Tool**: `gh pr create`
- Strip `Made with Cursor` if injected

```sh
gh pr create --title "concise title" --body "$(cat <<'EOF'
## Summary
- ...

## Test plan
- [ ] ...
EOF
)"
```

Return the PR URL. Do not post review comments unless asked.
